  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NGO lead Rapid Response Programme to supported internally displaced populations in Eastern DRC.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity NGO lead Rapid Response Programme to supported internally displaced populations in Eastern DRC. is a component of Democratic Republic of Congo- Humanitarian Innovation, Response and Reform programme (DRCHIRRP)  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;33,689,051. It works in the following sector(s): Material relief assistance and services, Immediate post-emergency reconstruction and rehabilitation, Relief co-ordination and support services, Disaster prevention and preparedness.</narrative>
  </description>
